      "id": "f78f573d-e287-4c23-a10e-d1e4940c52d8",
      "name": "Criminal Controlled Rates",
      "description": {
        "content": "This endpoint provides the Legal Aid criminal controlled rates, which are the prescribed reimbursement rates for legal services provided under the Legal Aid Scheme.\n\n[Support Link](https://help.clio.com/hc/en-150/sections/9591010772379-Legal-Aid)\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
